# GMS's own ten levels, ending where GMS ends: 30% critical rate and 8%
# critical damage. The critical damage walks a staircase there --
# 3+floor(L/2)% -- and the ladder here is the straight line to the same
# endpoint, so level 1 reads 3.5% against GMS's 3%.
#
# The recovery is GMS's "10*L% chance to recover 2% of Max HP during the
# attack", which at their max is every attack. Written here as the expectation
# it comes to, because that is what an expected-damage fight can spend: 0.2% of
# the pool per landed swing at level 1, 2% at 10.
name: "Lord of Darkness"
description:
  "Increases Critical Rate and Critical Damage, and grants a chance to "
  "recover HP during the attack."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BERSERKER skill_order: 6 }
max_level: 10
base {
  crit_rate: 0.12
  crit_dmg: 0.035
  hp_recover_pct: 0.002
}
per_level {
  crit_rate: 0.02
  crit_dmg: 0.005
  hp_recover_pct: 0.002
}
